§ `Schedule paras 1(4) and 16`

#ASSERT `the body has High Court powers to imprison and enforce fines` `a commission of inquiry`
#ASSERT NOT `the body has High Court powers to imprison and enforce fines` `a committee of inquiry`

#ASSERT `the court referred to` `a commission of inquiry` EQUALS `the General Division of the High Court`
#ASSERT `the court referred to` `a committee of inquiry` EQUALS `a District Court`

