#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in years` `retaliating against a person for their evidence` EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in years` `insulting a member while the body sits` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the maximum imprisonment in years` `disobeying a summons` EQUALS 2

#ASSERT `the maximum fine` `wilfully giving false evidence on oath` EQUALS 10000

